 * This ability has two main components:
** Considers {{M|clones}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes, {{M|illusions}} and other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Spell Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Does not work with {{M|item}} abilities cast.
*** Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|weaver_threads_of_fate_established}} after the following abilities' respective applied damage components, under the following conditions:
**** {{A|Weaver|The Swarm}}
***** Applies the debuff after the {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}} component.
**** {{A|Weaver|Shukuchi}}
***** Applies the debuff after the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} component.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} 
*** For Weaver's successful attacks, including {{M|instant attack}} sources, the ability effects are applied as follows:
***# Applies the debuff.
***# Weaver's attack instance.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|weaver_threads_of_fate_established}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* {{#var:Threads of Fate value2}} seconds after debuff application, the ability checks if Weaver is within {{Code|≤ {{#var:Threads of Fate value3}}-distance}} to the debuff-affected enemy, and activates the debuff.
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Link}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#** Each source of Threads of Fate may apply the debuff once per enemy hero.
*#** Reapplying the debuff on another enemy hero creates an independent {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|weaver_threads_of_fate (x)}} instance on Weaver.
*#** Does not grant {{M|vision}}.
*#** The link does not break when the debuff-affected enemy unit is affected by the following sources:
*#*** The {{M|Fog of War}}.
*#*** {{M|Invisible}} sources.
*#** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#*** The ability effects visually draws to the location where the affected enemy unit was under {{M|vision}} previously.
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Linkbreak}}
*#** The link breaks in the following conditions:
*#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|AffectedEnemyPosition - WeaverPosition ≥ {{#var:Threads of Fate type1 value1}} , LinkBreak}}
*#** Upon either the affected enemy's or Death Prophet's {{M|death}}.
*# The {{M|movement speed}} slow.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|weaver_threads_of_fate (x)}}
*#* Grants flat {{M|bonus attack damage}} based on Weaver's current {{M|main attack damage}}, values are periodically checked and the bonus values are updated immediately.

