* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** The Swarm has a {{#var:The Swarm basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* {{M|Instant kills}} the Beetle, and neither grants the {{M|gold}} nor {{M|experience}} bounty in the following conditions:
** {{Symbol|Attached-type Units}}
*** Affected by {{A|Faceless Void|Chronosphere}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Affected by the following sources:
**** {{M|Invisible}} sources, without an ally {{M|True Sight}} source applied to the affected enemy.
**** {{A|Lifestealer|Infest}} into an allied unit.
**** {{A|Snapfire|Gobble Up}}
**** {{A|Witch Doctor|Voodoo Switcheroo}}
*** The Beetle applies its first debuff instance on {{M|untargetable}} sources, then instant kills itself after 4 {{M|server tick|text=server ticks}}.

* Has the following max ability values over {{calc|floor({{#var:The Swarm type1 value5}}/v1+1)|v1={{#var:The Swarm type1 value2}}}} instances, over the entire duration, per Beetle:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Deals a max {{calc|floor({{#var:The Swarm type1 value5}}/v1+1)*v2|v1={{#var:The Swarm type1 value2}}|v2={{#var:The Swarm type1 value3}}}} {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]).
*** Reduces a max {{calc|floor({{#var:The Swarm type1 value5}}/v1+1)*{{#var:The Swarm type1 value4}}|v1={{#var:The Swarm type1 value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|floor({{#var:The Swarm type1 value5}}/v1+1)*{{#var:The Swarm type1 value4 tal}}|v1={{#var:The Swarm type1 value2}}}}|20tal}}) {{M|armor}}.

