 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Geminate Attack is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Both {{M|Autocast}} and an active cast uses Weaver's current {{M|attack range}}.
*** Has Autocast on by default.
*** Unlike other active attack modifiers, it can proc while affected by {{M|silence}} sources, if set to {{M|Autocast}}.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component can be applied by other [[instant attack]] sources.

* The ability has two main componets:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]]
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** Applies the following buffs on that grants the {{M|unique bonus attack damage}} bonus upon Weaver's {{M|attack point}}:
***** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|weaver_geminate_attack}}
***** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|weaver_geminate_attack_bonus}}
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** The ability effects are applied as follows on the attacked enemy unit:
****# Weaver's attack instance.
****# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{A|Weaver|Threads of Fate}}
****# {{#var:Geminate Attack value1}} seconds after launching the attack {{M|projectile}}, Geminate Attack procs.
****#* Can proc on the following units:
****#** {{M|Buildings}}
****#** {{M|Couriers}}
****#** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
****#* Cannot proc on the following units:
****#** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
****#** {{I|Observer and Sentry Wards}}.
****# Applies {{#var:Geminate Attack value2}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Geminate Attack value2 tal}}|25tal}}) extra attacks utilizing the {{M|instant attack}} mechanic on the attacked enemy unit.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] 
*** The extra attack component has the following properties:
**** Has {{M|Global}} {{M|attack range}}.
**** If the initial attack instance kills the enemy unit before Geminate Attack procs, the extra attacks are still released, attacking the {{M|dead}} enemy unit.
*** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
**** Procs any {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal.
**** Do not have {{M|True Strike}}.
**** Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
**** Does not break the following {{M|invisibility}} sources:
***** {{A|Smoke of Deceit|Disguise}}
***** {{A|Ninja Gear|Solitary Disguise}}
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|weaver_geminate_attack_mark}}
** Breaking {{A|Weaver|Shukuchi}}'s {{M|invisibility}} in any way now procs Geminate Attack {{ValueColor||{{#var:Geminate Attack type1 value2 shd}}|shd}} seconds after, on all enemy units affected by the Shukuchi debuff within the search radius.
*** The extra attacks procs on all enemy targets with the debuff, regardless of source.
*** The {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} works independently of Geminate Attack, and regardless of the ability's {{M|cooldown}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Geminate Attack icon0}}
| desc = Allows Weaver to dispatch two attacks at once.
}}
* For {{M|melee}} units, if the enemy target is {{G|melee miss range}} range farther than the attacker's range, the attack will {{M|miss}} regardless.

